.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
lpui                             # open the screen (same as `lpui ui`)
lpui list                        # show everything as a tree
lpui list --status doing
lpui show --kind plan --id 1
lpui --actor alice add-plan --title \(dqAPI v2\(dq --why \(dq..\(dq
lpui --actor alice add-criteria --kind plan --id 1 --text \(dqWorks offline\(dq
lpui --actor alice add-task --milestone 1 --title \(dqFix bug\(dq
lpui status --kind task --id 3 --to done
lpui upgrade --check
lpui maint report --days 30.days
lpui maint archive --days 7
lpui maint trim --apply
lpui maint vacuum --apply
lpui maint restore --plan 3
lpui feed --limit 20
lpui export --format json > backup.json
lpui import --file backup.json
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LAZYPLAN_DB
Which database file to use (same as --db).
.TP
.B LAZYPLAN_PORCELAIN
Print terse tab-separated rows for active agents; --json still wins.
.TP
.B LAZYPLAN_NO_SETUP
Skip first-run setup and upgrade review when set.
.TP
.B LAZYPLAN_AGENTS
Default agent list for setup; an explicit flag wins.
.TP
.B LAZYPLAN_SKILLS_DIR
Default skill directory for setup; an explicit flag wins.
.TP
.B LAZYPLAN_NO_SKILLS
Install no agent skill when set.
.TP
.B LAZYPLAN_NO_HOOKS
Silence installed hooks at runtime; does not remove them.
.TP
.B LAZYPLAN_THEME
TUI palette: mocha, void, or latte (aliases dark, oled, light).
.TP
.B LAZYPLAN_NO_COLOR
Disable setup wizard color.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR, CLICOLOR=0, TERM=dumb
Plain setup output.
.TP
.B USER, USERNAME
Used for --actor when you do not give one (USERNAME on Windows).
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/\.lazyplan/lazyplan\.db
Your plans, shared by every agent and folder (default home).
.TP
.B %LOCALAPPDATA%/lazyplan/
The shared home on Windows, in place of ~/.lazyplan/.
.TP
.B \.agents/lazyplan/lazyplan\.db
The repo database (only with lpui setup --placement repo; keep it local).
.TP
.B \.agents/lazyplan/config\.json
Repo marker; commit it with the plan.
.TP
.B \.agents/lazyplan/templates/{plan,milestone,task}\.md
Repo creation templates; commit them to share defaults.
.TP
.B ~/\.lazyplan/templates/{plan,milestone,task}\.md
Home creation templates.
.TP
.B ~/\.lazyplan/setup\.json
Remembered setup choices and migration decisions.
.TP
.B ~/\.lazyplan/notes\-seen\.json
Last version whose release notes were shown.
.TP
.B ~/\.lazyplan/backups/<timestamp>/
Tree-preserving backups of every touched file.
.TP
.B ~/\.agents/skills/lazyplan/SKILL\.md
Universal agent skill; per-tool skill directories are written too.
.TP
.B ~/\.config/opencode/plugins/lazyplan\.js, ~/\.claude/settings\.json, ~/\.gemini/settings\.json, ~/\.codex/hooks\.json, ~/\.cursor/hooks\.json
Managed lifecycle hook surfaces; they also track session state.
.TP
.B AGENTS\.md
Optional marked lazyplan section in a repo.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
It worked.
.TP
.B 1
The id you gave was not found (for example, task #7).
.TP
.B 2
The flags or input were wrong (details start with error: ... on stderr).
.TP
.B 3
The screen cannot start (Textual is not installed).
